                "widget": {
                    "title": "",
                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f Capacity, Quota & Request Shape  `[v3.1-iter1]`\nProvisioned Throughput (PTU) vs Pay-as-you-go routing, prompt/output size histograms, and API method patterns.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** 00 Usage Summary | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | 02 Fleet Overview | 03 Latency & SLOs | 04 Errors & Reliability | 05 Caching & FinOps | **[06 Capacity & Quota]**  \n*Interactive Filters active above: filter dynamically by Model, Region (`location`), Version (`model_version_id`), and API Method (`method`).*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#1A2E0A",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
                            "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
                            "verticalAlignment": "V_CENTER"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 5,
                "width": 48,
                "height": 4,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udd11 24h Capacity & Routing Scorecards",
                    "sectionHeader": {
                        "subtitle": "Provisioned vs shared request routing ratios and total consumed throughput",
                        "dividerBelow": true
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 9,
                "width": 12,
                "height": 12,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "Total Requests (24h)",
                    "scorecard": {
                        "timeSeriesQuery": {
                            "timeSeriesFilter": {
                                "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/model_invocation_count\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/PublisherModel\" resource.label.\"publisher\"=\"anthropic\"",
                                "aggregation": {
                                    "alignmentPeriod": "86400s",
                                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "sparkChartView": {
                            "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
